{"id":6177,"date":"2021-02-24T19:27:37","date_gmt":"2021-02-24T16:27:37","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/gruv-apps.com\/?p=6177"},"modified":"2021-02-26T13:31:30","modified_gmt":"2021-02-26T10:31:30","slug":"black-bulls-and-white-cows","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/en.gruv-apps.com\/black-bulls-and-white-cows\/","title":{"rendered":"Black Bulls And White Cows"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Remember the classic Master Mind game from the Seventies?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It is also called &#171;Bulls and Cows&#187;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You might know this game from your childhood as it is a digital version of the classic Mastermind board game.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Now it&#8217;s available for FREE for your phone and tablet.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The goal is to guess the hidden digital combinations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your opponent (the computer \/ phone) creates a combination of up to four digits and hides it at the top of the game board.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your task is to try out different digital combinations until you match the hidden code.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>After each try, you get a hint to see how many numbers you have correct:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>-Black key: There is a digit that is in the combination and at the right place.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>-White key: There is a digit that is in the combination but not at the right place.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The challenge is to pick the correct numerical code as quickly as possible \u2014 in other words,<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>to see how fast you can guess the hidden color combination.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Its a very addictive puzzle game.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are 3 categories of difficulty and 6 groups by dimension (3 pins, 4 pins, 5 pins, 6 pins, 7 pins, 8 pins).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Each categorie has 50 &#8212; 1000 levels.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are more then 10000 tasks.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Remember the classic Master Mind game from the Seventies? It is also called &#171;Bulls and Cows&#187;. You might know this game from your childhood as i